The Reckoning of Initiative, a mechanical interlude.

Trump, the force of the first combatant.
Shakespeare, the force of the second combatant.
Chorus, the difference that determines who speaks first.
Romeo, the energy restored to Trump.
Juliet, the energy restored to Shakespeare.
Hamlet, the guard that time removes.
Ophelia, the greatest energy the stage permits.

Act I: The ordering of every round.
Scene I: resolve round.
[Enter Chorus and Trump]
Trump:
You are as decisive as the difference between Trump and Shakespeare.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Romeo and Juliet]
Juliet:
You are as generous as a brave hero.
Romeo:
You are as generous as a brave hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Hamlet and Ophelia]
Ophelia:
You are as fading as a brave noble hero.
Hamlet:
You are as abundant as the sum of a brave noble gentle hero and a brave hero.
[Exeunt]
